Automobile Management System (AMS)

AMS (Automobile Management System) is a console-based Java application developed as part of learning Java programming and Object-Oriented Programming concepts.


Features
Admin can add new cars.
Customers can view available cars.
Cars can be filtered by:
Price
Make
Seating capacity
Fuel type
Customers can book a car.
Customers can sell their cars through the system.
Car and selling details are stored using text files (cars.txt and sellcars.txt).
Java Concepts Used
Classes and Objects
Constructors
Inheritance
Method Overriding
Encapsulation
ArrayList
File Handling
Exception Handling
Scanner
Loops and Conditional Statements
Switch Statements

Technologies: Java, Maven
